---
import { siteLinks } from "../data/site";
---

<section class="experience-section section-space" id="experiencia" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
  <div class="shell mx-auto">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading--split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__line"></span> 03 / FRENTES DE ATUAÇÃO</p>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="experience-title">
          Duas especialidades. <span>Aplicações distintas.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-heading__aside body-copy">
        A NeuroLicence atende empresas. A engenharia algorítmica e os produtos de trading atendem traders. TAPF e HUB integram a infraestrutura própria.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="experience-grid grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
      <article class="experience-card">
        <div class="experience-card__meta">
          <span class="experience-card__number">01</span>
          <span class="experience-card__type">EMPRESAS · NEUROLICENCE</span>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-card__art experience-card__art--code" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="code-line code-line--short"></span>
          <span class="code-line"></span>
          <span class="code-line code-line--offset"></span>
          <span class="code-line code-line--medium"></span>
          <span class="code-line code-line--short"></span>
          <span class="code-cursor"></span>
          <span class="code-caption">SISTEMAS / OPERAÇÃO</span>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-card__copy">
          <h3>Sistemas personalizados</h3>
          <p>Aplicações web, plataformas SaaS e sistemas construídos para necessidades específicas de cada organização.</p>
        </div>
        <a
          class="experience-card__link"
          href={siteLinks.neuroLicence}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Conhecer a NeuroLicence <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="experience-card">
        <div class="experience-card__meta">
          <span class="experience-card__number">02</span>
          <span class="experience-card__type">EMPRESAS · NEUROLICENCE</span>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-card__art experience-card__art--flow" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 300 116" fill="none">
            <path d="M66 58h55m58 0h55" stroke="#D2D2DC" stroke-opacity=".5" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <rect x="10" y="38" width="56" height="40" rx="6" stroke="#3080F0" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <rect x="121" y="38" width="58" height="40" rx="6" stroke="#3020A0" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <rect x="234" y="38" width="56" height="40" rx="6" stroke="#3080F0" stroke-width="1.5" />
            <circle cx="38" cy="58" r="5" fill="#3080F0" fill-opacity=".82" />
            <circle cx="150" cy="58" r="5" fill="#E9E9E9" fill-opacity=".8" />
            <circle cx="262" cy="58" r="5" fill="#3020A0" />
          </svg>
          <span class="code-caption">FLUXOS / INTEGRAÇÕES</span>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-card__copy">
          <h3>Automação empresarial</h3>
          <p>Processos operacionais e administrativos conectados a sistemas, APIs e bancos de dados.</p>
        </div>
        <a
          class="experience-card__link"
          href={siteLinks.neuroLicence}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Explorar soluções empresariais <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="experience-card">
        <div class="experience-card__meta">
          <span class="experience-card__number">03</span>
          <span class="experience-card__type">FINANCEIRO · MQL5</span>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-card__art experience-card__art--cycles" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 300 116" fill="none">
            <path d="M10 83h37l18-24 21 17 24-38 22 29 24-19 22 4 23-31 23 15 26-27" stroke="#3080F0" stroke-opacity=".78" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
            <path d="M10 100h280" stroke="#D2D2DC" stroke-opacity=".2" />
            <path d="M10 57h280" stroke="#D2D2DC" stroke-opacity=".13" stroke-dasharray="4 6" />
            <circle cx="245" cy="21" r="4" fill="#3020A0" />
          </svg>
          <span class="code-caption">FIBOMAT / CYCLEFX PRO</span>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-card__copy">
          <h3>Automação de estratégias</h3>
          <p>FiboMat aplica FIMATHE Raiz; CycleFX PRO combina Teoria dos Ciclos e PCM quantitativo no MetaTrader 5.</p>
        </div>
        <a
          class="experience-card__link"
          href={siteLinks.tradingProducts}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Conhecer os produtos <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="experience-card">
        <div class="experience-card__meta">
          <span class="experience-card__number">04</span>
          <span class="experience-card__type">INFRAESTRUTURA · HUB</span>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-card__art experience-card__art--hub" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="hub-line hub-line--one"></span>
          <span class="hub-line hub-line--two"></span>
          <span class="hub-node hub-node--center">
            <img
              class="hub-node__logo"
              src="/assets/logo-160.webp"
              width="160"
              height="160"
              alt=""
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </span>
          <span class="hub-node hub-node--left"></span>
          <span class="hub-node hub-node--right"></span>
          <span class="hub-node hub-node--bottom"></span>
          <span class="code-caption">HUB DO PARCEIRO</span>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-card__copy">
          <h3>Plataformas próprias</h3>
          <p>TAPF e HUB do Parceiro integram a frente de plataformas do ecossistema.</p>
        </div>
        <a
          class="experience-card__link"
          href={siteLinks.partnerHub}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Acessar o HUB do Parceiro <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="experience-disclaimer">
      Produtos de trading estão sujeitos ao risco de mercado. Automação não elimina riscos nem garante resultados financeiros.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
